<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  /* Basic styling to mimic document structure */
  body { font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif; }
  h1, h2, h3 { text-align: center; }
  .signature-line { border-bottom: 1px solid #000; margin-top: 50px; margin-bottom: 50px; }
</style>

<div class="page">
  <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 40px;">
    <img src="placeholder_logo.png" alt="Logo" style="height: 80px; margin-bottom: 10px;">
    <h1 style="font-size: 24pt; margin: 0;">ACCESSIBILITY<br>RESOURCE<br>CENTER</h1>
  </div>

  <h2 style="text-align: center; font-size: 18pt; margin-bottom: 10px;">Audio-Recording Lectures Agreement</h2>
  <h3 style="text-align: center; font-size: 14pt; margin-top: 0;">University of New Mexico</h3>
  <h3 style="text-align: center; font-size: 14pt; margin-top: 0;">Accessibility Resource Center</h3>

  <p style="text-align: justify; line-height: 1.5;">
    Accessibility Resource Center makes every effort to assist students with disabilities who may need to audio-record lectures. Students agree to comply with the procedures outlined below. Adherence to these procedures allows the full opportunity for academic freedom for the professor and fellow students.
  </p>

  <ol style="line-height: 1.5;">
    <li>My audio-recordings of lectures must be used only for my personal private study, and they must not be reproduced, passed on, or made available to any third party.</li>
    <li>I agree to delete the recordings once they are no longer needed.</li>
  </ol>

  <p style="text-align: justify; margin-top: 30px;">
    I acknowledge and agree to the terms and conditions of this agreement.
  </p>

  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 80px;">
    <div style="width: 45%;">
      <p>Student Signature</p>
      <div class="signature-line"></div>
      <p style="margin-top: 5px;">Date</p>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 45%;">
      <p>Accessibility Resource Center</p>
      <div class="signature-line"></div>
      <p style="margin-top: 5px;">Date</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="text-align: center; font-size: 9pt; margin-top: 100px; color: #555;">
    The University of New Mexico <span data-field="address_line_1">{{ address_line_1 }}</span> <span data-field="city">{{ city }}</span>, <span data-field="state">{{ state }}</span> <span data-field="zip_code">{{ zip_code }}</span> | Phone: <span data-field="phone">{{ phone }}</span> Fax: <span data-field="fax">{{ fax }}</span>
  </div>
</div>